<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" description="How the AF Construction website handles your information.">
<p>This Privacy Policy explains how AF Construction ("we", "us") handles information when you visit this website or contact us. We keep it simple: this website does not ask you to create an account, and it does not collect or store personal details on our servers.</p>

<h2>Information you share with us</h2>
<p>The project inquiry form on our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> works entirely in your browser. When you fill it in, it prepares a summary on your own device so you can copy it. The form does not send, save or email your name or project details to us or anyone else.</p>
<p>If you choose to call us at <a href={phone.href}>{phone.label}</a> or message us through Yelp or Instagram, we receive the details you decide to share, such as your name, phone number, address and a description of your project. We use this information only to respond, prepare estimates and carry out the work you ask for.</p>

<h2>Third-party services</h2>
<p>Some parts of this website come from other companies, which have their own privacy policies:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Instagram (Meta):</strong> our Projects page shows videos embedded from <a href={instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our Instagram account</a>. When these load, Instagram may collect information such as your IP address and set cookies. See Meta's Privacy Policy for details.</li>
<li><strong>Yelp:</strong> links to <a href={yelp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our Yelp page</a> take you to Yelp's website, where Yelp's own privacy policy applies.</li>
<li><strong>Website hosting:</strong> like most websites, our hosting provider may keep standard server logs (such as IP address, browser type and pages visited) for security and performance.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How we use and share information</h2>
<p>We use information you give us to communicate with you, provide estimates and complete your project. We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it except with people who help us complete your project (for example, subcontractors or suppliers) or when required by law.</p>

<h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
<p>If you live in California, you may have rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), including the right to know what personal information we hold about you and to ask us to delete it. To make a request, call us at <a href={phone.href}>{phone.label}</a>.</p>

<h2>Children</h2>
<p>This website is intended for adults planning construction and home improvement work. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>

<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last changed.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about this policy? Call AF Construction at <a href={phone.href}>{phone.label}</a> or visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
